# Canonicalises commit identities for display (git shortlog/log --use-mailmap,
# and GitHub's contributors graph). This corrects DISPLAY ONLY — it does not
# rewrite history or change commit SHAs. See `git help shortlog` (MAPPING AUTHORS).
#
# Early commits used a placeholder identity before the maintainer identity was
# configured; map them to the canonical GitHub no-reply identity.
SCPG <1386818+scpg@users.noreply.github.com> <test@example.com>
SCPG <1386818+scpg@users.noreply.github.com> Test User <test@example.com>
